Features:

-Transfer learning with EfficientNetV2B0 (ImageNet pretrained)
-Custom classification head for medical imaging
-Robust dataset pipeline with proper train/val/test splits
-Class imbalance handling using class weights
-Advanced label-aware data augmentation
-Threshold optimization using precision-recall tradeoff
-Comprehensive evaluation with precision, recall, and F1-score

Problems and Solutions:

-Handling Class Imbalance
Dataset exhibited imbalance (~1:2.7 ratio).

Solution:
Computed class weights using:
compute_class_weight('balanced', ...)
Applied during training:
model.fit(..., class_weight=class_weight_dict)

-Data Augmentation

Implemented label-aware augmentation strategy:
Class 0 (minority / NORMAL):
Heavy augmentation (rotation, zoom, brightness, contrast)
Class 1 (PNEUMONIA):
30% probability of light augmentation
Otherwise left unchanged

Final implementation uses batch-safe TensorFlow operations (tf.where) to avoid shape errors and improve performance.
